The further submissions of the learned Senior Counsel for the revisionist are as under:
(a) The deceased was student of Class- VIIIth, aged about 14 years;
(b) On 11.07.2022 at about 06:30 P.M. the offence of committing rape was attempted by the revisionist and other co-accused persons in the market in front of her brother Vishnu Mohan and after 30 minutes of the incident, the victim committed suicide in her house on the railing of stairs;
(c) As per postmortem report, except ligature mark, no other injury was found on the person of the deceased/victim;
(d) No other evidence has been collected with regard to committing the offence of attempt to rape by the revisionist and other co-accused persons;
(e) The brother of the deceased is an eye witness of the incident;
(f) As per allegation of the F.I.R., attempt to rape was taken place in the market;
(g) The muffler, by which the suicide has been committed by the victim has been delivered by the father of the deceased to the police;
(h) The revisionist has no criminal history;
